  "query": "SELECT s.id, s.account_id,\n                  a.username, a.display_name\n           FROM statuses s\n           JOIN accounts a ON a.id = s.account_id\n           WHERE s.id = $1\n             AND s.deleted_at IS NULL\n             AND s.visibility IN (0, 1)",
